KPL/IK

Hayabusa2 MASCOT MASMAG Instrument kernel
==============================================================================

   This instrument kernel (I-kernel) contains no parameters but instrument's
   description for the Hayabusa2 MASCOT magnetometer (MASMAG) instrument.


Version and Date
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

   Version 0.0     -- January 17, 2024 -- David Hercik, TU-Braunschweig,
                                          instrument provider, and
                                          Shin-ya Murakami, ISAS/JAXA

      - Initial version.


